== 0c. Maintenance: hentikan penulis sebelum dump
  > docker compose -f /home/hatch/workspace/UMNIA-APP/deploy/windows/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy stop business-api
  penulis dihentikan: business-api
  > docker compose -f /home/hatch/workspace/UMNIA-APP/deploy/windows/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy stop web
  penulis dihentikan: web
  penulis berhenti: tidak ada sesi aktif umnia_business

== 1. Dump database lama (custom format, --no-owner)
  > docker compose -f /home/hatch/workspace/UMNIA-APP/deploy/windows/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy exec -T postgres-business pg_dump -U umnia_business -d umnia_business --no-owner -Fc -f /tmp/umnia-backup.dump

== 2. Salin backup keluar (docker cp, binary-safe)
  > docker cp deadbeef0001:/tmp/umnia-backup.dump /tmp/umnia-upg-faildown-efdf60c2/backups/umnia-backup-20261106-013543.dump

== 3. Validasi backup SEBELUM menghentikan stack lama
  ukuran backup: 33462 byte
  pg_restore -l OK (memuat tabel workspaces)
  > docker compose -f /home/hatch/workspace/UMNIA-APP/deploy/windows/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy exec -T postgres-business rm -f /tmp/umnia-backup.dump

== 4. Hentikan stack lama (volume DIPERTAHANKAN, tanpa -v)
  > docker compose -f /home/hatch/workspace/UMNIA-APP/deploy/windows/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy down

== 5. Jalankan postgres project baru (volume kosong -> initdb)
